WEBVTT

1
01:02:51.778 --> 01:02:53.778
Please take a seat.

2
01:03:05.178 --> 01:03:11.578
About a year or two ago, God spoke to Tim that we should build a new building.

3
01:03:11.578 --> 01:03:19.178
At that moment, the hall was not full at all, nor was it empty, per se.

4
01:03:19.178 --> 01:03:23.978
But God spoke clearly to him with multiple confirmations.

5
01:03:23.978 --> 01:03:31.178
And then we entered a process together to work towards the fact that a new building needs to come.

6
01:03:31.178 --> 01:03:35.378
And it has now also become clear that it is quite necessary.

7
01:03:35.378 --> 01:03:41.578
A few weeks ago, there were 382 people who wanted to enter the hall.

8
01:03:41.578 --> 01:03:45.578
But we only have 300 chairs, and the fire department does not allow more.

9
01:03:45.578 --> 01:03:53.778
So many people had to sit in the back room there, and quite a few even went home.

10
01:03:53.778 --> 01:03:59.178
Yes, so it is really needed.

11
01:03:59.178 --> 01:04:02.578
God knows what He is doing and God knows where He is leading us.

12
01:04:02.578 --> 01:04:05.378
But such a building is not so simple.

13
01:04:05.378 --> 01:04:11.378
You don't just design it in a few weeks, gather some money, and start digging in the ground.

14
01:04:11.378 --> 01:04:13.778
No, it is a huge project.

15
01:04:13.778 --> 01:04:18.778
And we have been working together for two years to raise funds,

16
01:04:18.778 --> 01:04:22.778
to make plans, to see how we are going to tackle it all.

17
01:04:22.778 --> 01:04:28.578
And this week we took another beautiful step in that process.

18
01:04:28.578 --> 01:04:31.778
We have signed the construction contract.

19
01:04:32.778 --> 01:04:38.778
APPLAUSE

20
01:04:38.778 --> 01:04:44.778
And you can see it by the number of pages; there were 60.

21
01:04:44.778 --> 01:04:47.778
Every page must have a signature.

22
01:04:47.778 --> 01:04:54.778
That means that both we and the construction company have been working on this for months and months.

23
01:04:54.778 --> 01:05:02.778
Tim, Bram, Debbie, Roland, many people from this church have really invested a tremendous amount of time in it.

24
01:05:02.778 --> 01:05:06.778
And it has to be that way, because you don't just do anything. It's God's house.

25
01:05:06.778 --> 01:05:09.778
It must be good.

26
01:05:09.778 --> 01:05:14.778
And so after a lot of work, it has been precisely put on paper.

27
01:05:14.778 --> 01:05:18.778
That's what those 60 pages are for. What are we going to do exactly?

28
01:05:18.778 --> 01:05:25.778
Last week we signed it, and so we are one step further.

29
01:05:25.778 --> 01:05:28.778
That does cost something, of course, you all know that.

30
01:05:28.778 --> 01:05:31.778
We are saving up for that together.

31
01:05:31.778 --> 01:05:42.778
And if I may have the slide from the previous status, that is what we had raised together until the last quarter.

32
01:05:42.778 --> 01:05:53.778
That was really amazing. We have raised 842,000 together as a congregation over the past years.

33
01:05:53.778 --> 01:05:56.778
When you think about it, that's flabbergasting.

34
01:05:56.778 --> 01:05:59.778
With such a small group of people.

35
01:05:59.778 --> 01:06:05.778
And it keeps going, because you see that in the first two quarters, over 30,000 has been added each time.

36
01:06:05.778 --> 01:06:11.778
And in the last quarter, over 30,000 has been added again.

37
01:06:13.778 --> 01:06:21.778
Amazing, right? Thank you for your faithfulness and your commitment to build God's kingdom.

38
01:06:21.778 --> 01:06:28.778
Because it is so precious, as it concerns the eternal salvation of the people around us, from the Kempen.

39
01:06:28.778 --> 01:06:31.778
But it's not enough.

40
01:06:31.778 --> 01:06:33.778
Not at Langena.

41
01:06:33.778 --> 01:06:39.778
If I am correct, more than 3 million is needed to complete the entire project.

42
01:06:40.778 --> 01:06:45.778
And so we have been to more than 10 banks.

43
01:06:45.778 --> 01:06:48.778
Especially Tim and Bram have done that.

44
01:06:48.778 --> 01:06:51.778
And in the end, we were rejected by all the banks.

45
01:06:57.778 --> 01:06:59.778
Amen yes, because that is great.

46
01:06:59.778 --> 01:07:03.778
I will show why. May I have my Bible verse?

47
01:07:04.778 --> 01:07:10.778
When he stepped out of the boat, Jesus of course, he saw the large crowd of people.

48
01:07:10.778 --> 01:07:14.778
He had compassion for them, for they were like sheep without a shepherd.

49
01:07:14.778 --> 01:07:16.778
Here is the Kempen.

50
01:07:16.778 --> 01:07:19.778
And he began to teach many things.

51
01:07:19.778 --> 01:07:26.778
When it had already become late, his disciples came to him and said, 'It is lonely here and it is already late.'

52
01:07:27.778 --> 01:07:33.778
Send the people away now, so they can go to the villages around here to buy food.

53
01:07:33.778 --> 01:07:35.778
For they have nothing to eat with them.

54
01:07:35.778 --> 01:07:41.778
It resembles a bit the people who had to leave here because they no longer fit in the hall.

55
01:07:41.778 --> 01:07:45.778
But Jesus said, 'You give them something to eat.'

56
01:07:46.778 --> 01:07:48.778
How?

57
01:07:48.778 --> 01:07:50.778
Yes but, Jesus.

58
01:07:50.778 --> 01:07:52.778
They said it to him.

59
01:07:52.778 --> 01:07:57.778
Should we go and buy bread for 200 silver coins to give them something to eat?

60
01:07:58.778 --> 01:08:02.778
In other words, that is completely impossible. How can we arrange this now?

61
01:08:02.778 --> 01:08:06.778
We are here in a situation. That whole mountain is filled with thousands and thousands of people.

62
01:08:06.778 --> 01:08:08.778
They have been listening to Jesus all day long.

63
01:08:08.778 --> 01:08:12.778
The food is gone. How are we going to fix this?

64
01:08:12.778 --> 01:08:15.778
Those people need to go home, otherwise this will go completely wrong.

65
01:08:15.778 --> 01:08:20.778
But Jesus says, go and see how much bread you have.

66
01:08:20.778 --> 01:08:25.778
When they had done that, they said five loaves and two fish.

67
01:08:25.778 --> 01:08:29.778
It seems a bit like our 800,000 euros.

68
01:08:29.778 --> 01:08:33.778
We have done together what we had.

69
01:08:33.778 --> 01:08:37.778
We have brought together everything we had, a super beautiful effort from everyone,

70
01:08:37.778 --> 01:08:39.778
we have been able to gather.

71
01:08:39.778 --> 01:08:43.778
800,000 euros, five loaves and two fish.

72
01:08:43.778 --> 01:08:48.778
Jesus told them to have the people sit down in groups on the grass.

73
01:08:48.778 --> 01:08:52.778
They sat down in groups of 150.

74
01:08:52.778 --> 01:08:59.778
He took the five loaves and the two fish, looked up to heaven and blessed them.

75
01:08:59.778 --> 01:09:03.778
Then he broke the loaves into pieces, which he gave to the disciples to distribute.

76
01:09:03.778 --> 01:09:07.778
He also divided the two fish among all the people.

77
01:09:07.778 --> 01:09:10.778
The people ate until they were full.

78
01:09:10.778 --> 01:09:12.778
Full hall.

79
01:09:12.778 --> 01:09:15.778
Then they collected the pieces that were left over.

80
01:09:15.778 --> 01:09:20.778
Twelve baskets full, also what was left of the fish, they gathered again.

81
01:09:20.778 --> 01:09:25.778
About five thousand men had eaten of those loaves.

82
01:09:25.778 --> 01:09:28.778
And also women and children.

83
01:09:28.778 --> 01:09:31.778
Amazing, how can this be?

84
01:09:32.778 --> 01:09:37.778
It's easy to read this as a story in the Bible.

85
01:09:37.778 --> 01:09:41.778
Beautiful story, that's special, that's remarkable what Jesus does.

86
01:09:41.778 --> 01:09:44.778
But this is not a story, this is an event.

87
01:09:44.778 --> 01:09:46.778
This literally happened.

88
01:09:46.778 --> 01:09:51.778
You have to put yourself in the shoes of those disciples, that Jesus says to them, give them something to eat.

89
01:09:51.778 --> 01:09:54.778
Yes, but that is completely impossible. How can that be?

90
01:09:54.778 --> 01:09:56.778
The point is this.

91
01:09:56.778 --> 01:09:59.778
With God, all things are possible.

92
01:09:59.778 --> 01:10:04.778
He is Lord, He reigns, He has everything in His hands.

93
01:10:04.778 --> 01:10:07.778
His will must be done.

94
01:10:07.778 --> 01:10:11.778
If He wants a building to come, then a building must come.

95
01:10:11.778 --> 01:10:15.778
Step 1, see what we can do together.

96
01:10:15.778 --> 01:10:18.778
We have done that, 800,000 euros.

97
01:10:18.778 --> 01:10:22.778
Step 2, give it to Jesus and trust in Him.

98
01:10:22.778 --> 01:10:25.778
And that is the phase we are entering now.

99
01:10:25.778 --> 01:10:30.778
If the banks do not want to cooperate, fine, I know someone who does want to help.

100
01:10:30.778 --> 01:10:32.778
His name is Jesus.

101
01:10:32.778 --> 01:10:40.778
But it's not about, okay, here is Jesus and then sitting back waiting for it to happen.

102
01:10:40.778 --> 01:10:46.778
Jesus went together with His disciples, He was distributing it.

103
01:10:46.778 --> 01:10:50.778
What we need to do in this phase is pray.

104
01:10:51.778 --> 01:10:59.778
How dramatic would it be if we had gathered all that money together.

105
01:10:59.778 --> 01:11:01.778
Bank, just go along with it for a moment.

106
01:11:01.778 --> 01:11:04.778
Come on, we have everything together, we are going to build.

107
01:11:04.778 --> 01:11:06.778
Well, thank you God.

108
01:11:06.778 --> 01:11:08.778
No, that's not how God wants it.

109
01:11:08.778 --> 01:11:09.778
Very often in your life.

110
01:11:09.778 --> 01:11:13.778
We just sang about it, about walking on water.

111
01:11:13.778 --> 01:11:17.778
We need to live in a trusting relationship with God.

112
01:11:17.778 --> 01:11:19.778
And that applies to this building now as well.

113
01:11:19.778 --> 01:11:23.778
And we will see, you will see how God intervenes.

114
01:11:23.778 --> 01:11:26.778
How He is the one who builds His kingdom.

115
01:11:26.778 --> 01:11:28.778
Against all odds.

116
01:11:28.778 --> 01:11:31.778
In circumstances that seem impossible.

117
01:11:31.778 --> 01:11:35.778
We have seen it so often in the existence of this congregation.

118
01:11:35.778 --> 01:11:37.778
And we will see it again now.

119
01:11:37.778 --> 01:11:39.778
But we must pray.

120
01:11:39.778 --> 01:11:42.778
Let's enter a season together.

121
01:11:42.778 --> 01:11:44.778
Enter in, seek Him earnestly.

122
01:11:44.778 --> 01:11:46.778
And pray for this building.

123
01:11:46.778 --> 01:11:50.778
And do not be like the disciple who said, no that is completely impossible.

124
01:11:50.778 --> 01:11:53.778
Do not say, no this building will never work.

125
01:11:53.778 --> 01:11:56.778
If the benches do not cooperate, then it stops here.

126
01:11:56.778 --> 01:11:57.778
Do not do that.

127
01:11:57.778 --> 01:11:59.778
Where is your faith?

128
01:11:59.778 --> 01:12:03.778
Jesus wants us to have faith and trust in Him.

129
01:12:03.778 --> 01:12:05.778
Together with Him build the kingdom.

130
01:12:05.778 --> 01:12:07.778
So let us not say, this is not going to work.

131
01:12:07.778 --> 01:12:10.778
Let us say, Lord I do not know how it will go.

132
01:12:10.778 --> 01:12:12.778
A miracle is needed.

133
01:12:12.778 --> 01:12:13.778
We need You.

134
01:12:13.778 --> 01:12:15.778
Father help us.

135
01:12:15.778 --> 01:12:17.778
Father thank You.

136
01:12:17.778 --> 01:12:19.778
That You bless the congregation.

137
01:12:19.778 --> 01:12:20.778
That You build the congregation.

138
01:12:20.778 --> 01:12:22.778
That You look after this region.

139
01:12:22.778 --> 01:12:24.778
That You are the soul's desire.

140
01:12:24.778 --> 01:12:26.778
That all of Kempen will be saved.

141
01:12:26.778 --> 01:12:30.778
Thank You for the many people You bring here, Lord.

142
01:12:30.778 --> 01:12:32.778
But help us, Lord.

143
01:12:32.778 --> 01:12:34.778
In this project.

144
01:12:34.778 --> 01:12:36.778
That the hall will come soon.

145
01:12:36.778 --> 01:12:39.778
And it will be shown that You are a great God.

146
01:12:39.778 --> 01:12:41.778
A God of wonders and signs.

147
01:12:41.778 --> 01:12:43.778
A God who is trustworthy.

148
01:12:43.778 --> 01:12:46.778
A God who is with us through thick and thin.

149
01:12:46.778 --> 01:12:48.778
And paves the way for us.

150
01:12:48.778 --> 01:12:50.778
A God who makes us walk on water.

151
01:12:50.778 --> 01:12:52.778
We thank You and we honor You.

152
01:12:52.778 --> 01:12:55.778
People, enter this time in prayer for the building.

153
01:12:55.778 --> 01:12:57.778
Do not say it cannot be done.

154
01:12:57.778 --> 01:12:58.778
But say it can be done.

155
01:12:58.778 --> 01:13:00.778
For God is greater.

156
01:13:08.778 --> 01:13:11.778
Praise the name of Jesus. Amen.

157
01:13:12.778 --> 01:13:14.778
Hallelujah. Thank You, Robert, for that.

158
01:13:14.778 --> 01:13:16.778
That is truly uplifting.

159
01:13:16.778 --> 01:13:18.778
And it is powerful.

160
01:13:18.778 --> 01:13:19.778
I know.

161
01:13:19.778 --> 01:13:23.778
I was leveling with Bram.

162
01:13:23.778 --> 01:13:29.778
And I said how amazing it is that in 2023 the revelation came that we had to start building.

163
01:13:29.778 --> 01:13:32.778
2024 was the year of permits.

164
01:13:32.778 --> 01:13:35.778
2025 will be the year of financing.

165
01:13:35.778 --> 01:13:38.778
2026 we are going to build. Amen.

166
01:13:38.778 --> 01:13:39.778
Isn't that a good vision?

167
01:13:39.778 --> 01:13:40.778
But you know.

168
01:13:40.778 --> 01:13:44.778
In 2024 we saw a number of miraculous things.

169
01:13:44.778 --> 01:13:47.778
And so exactly what Robert just said.

170
01:13:47.778 --> 01:13:49.778
2024 was miraculous.

171
01:13:49.778 --> 01:13:51.778
God opened doors.

172
01:13:51.778 --> 01:13:52.778
Two pieces of land.

173
01:13:52.778 --> 01:13:54.778
Given to us.

174
01:13:54.778 --> 01:14:00.778
Both accountants and notaries and architects can hardly believe such a story.

175
01:14:00.778 --> 01:14:03.778
It's hardly believable that you get two pieces of land.

176
01:14:03.778 --> 01:14:04.778
All that favor.

177
01:14:04.778 --> 01:14:07.778
Also the granting of the permit within six months.

178
01:14:08.778 --> 01:14:09.778
Timestamp.

179
01:14:09.778 --> 01:14:10.778
July 10.

180
01:14:10.778 --> 01:14:11.778
Timestamp.

181
01:14:11.778 --> 01:14:12.778
On December 10th we had our permit.

182
01:14:12.778 --> 01:14:16.778
No longer exists today.

183
01:14:16.778 --> 01:14:20.778
And so during that permit period we saw wonders of God.

184
01:14:20.778 --> 01:14:23.778
And so we must also believe in wonders of God now.

185
01:14:23.778 --> 01:14:25.778
Instead of what Robert just said.

186
01:14:25.778 --> 01:14:28.778
That we are just kind of struggling to do something.

187
01:14:28.778 --> 01:14:30.778
If God says no, praise the Lord.

188
01:14:30.778 --> 01:14:31.778
Amen.

189
01:14:31.778 --> 01:14:33.778
For God will do it in His way.

190
01:14:33.778 --> 01:14:34.778
And I trust in that as well.

191
01:14:34.778 --> 01:14:35.778
In Jesus' name.

192
01:14:35.778 --> 01:14:37.778
Can we thank the band with a round of applause.

193
01:14:37.778 --> 01:14:39.778
For the faithful work they always do.

194
01:14:44.778 --> 01:14:47.778
Always serving on this stage.

195
01:14:47.778 --> 01:14:50.778
And they often sing their hearts out.

196
01:14:50.778 --> 01:14:52.778
And I have respect for that.

197
01:14:52.778 --> 01:14:53.778
For what they are doing.

