01:15:30.778 --> 01:15:32.778
I just want to take a moment.

212
01:15:32.778 --> 01:15:34.778
I find it just a fun Bible verse.

213
01:15:34.778 --> 01:15:35.778
I just think it's amazing.

214
01:15:35.778 --> 01:15:36.778
So I'm going to.

215
01:15:36.778 --> 01:15:38.778
We're going to talk about chapter 4.

216
01:15:38.778 --> 01:15:40.778
But I just want to do verse 20 for a moment.

217
01:15:40.778 --> 01:15:42.778
From chapter 3.

218
01:15:42.778 --> 01:15:44.778
Ephesians chapter 3.

219
01:15:44.778 --> 01:15:46.778
What was that?

220
01:15:46.778 --> 01:15:48.778
Yes.

221
01:15:51.778 --> 01:15:54.778
You must eat God's Word.

