...and in verse 16 it states that everyone has their own task.

1029
01:55:23.778 --> 01:55:27.778
Jesus ensured that the body grows.

1030
01:55:27.778 --> 01:55:29.778
So that is the end.

1031
01:55:29.778 --> 01:55:32.778
He made unity into one whole.

1032
01:55:32.778 --> 01:55:34.778
The body is held together...

1033
01:55:34.778 --> 01:55:35.778
...by ligaments and bonds.

1034
01:55:35.778 --> 01:55:39.778
Each part of the body has its own task.

1035
01:55:39.778 --> 01:55:45.778
In the same way, Christ holds his congregation together.

1036
01:55:45.778 --> 01:55:46.778
Here we go.

1037
01:55:46.778 --> 01:55:51.778
And he gives each person their own task within the body.

1038
01:55:51.778 --> 01:55:56.778
When everyone does their task, the body grows...

1039
01:55:56.778 --> 01:56:00.778
...and becomes healthy, strong, and mature...

1040
01:56:00.778 --> 01:56:03.778
...through the love for God and people.

1041
01:56:03.778 --> 01:56:04.778
Shall we stand up?

1042
01:56:04.778 --> 01:56:09.778
Because I want to end with a prayer for our dear church.

1043
01:56:16.778 --> 01:56:18.778
Have we learned something today, church?

1044
01:56:18.778 --> 01:56:20.778
Nice, nice.

1045
01:56:20.778 --> 01:56:21.778
Can we close our eyes?

1046
01:56:21.778 --> 01:56:25.778
I will conclude the service with prayer.

1047
01:56:29.778 --> 01:56:36.778
Dear Father in heaven, we come to you in the name of Jesus.

1048
01:56:36.778 --> 01:56:39.778
We praise your holy name, Jesus Christ...

1049
01:56:39.778 --> 01:56:41.778
...for what you have done for us.

1050
01:56:41.778 --> 01:56:43.778
You suffered on a cross...

1051
01:56:43.778 --> 01:56:46.778
...while you were obedient to the Father.

1052
01:56:47.778 --> 01:56:50.778
And therefore you have all power and majesty...

1053
01:56:50.778 --> 01:56:54.778
...and we acknowledge you as Lord and Master.

1054
01:56:54.778 --> 01:56:56.778
Holy Spirit, I want to ask you...

1055
01:56:56.778 --> 01:57:01.778
...to fill all the people of Open Church with your glory...

1056
01:57:01.778 --> 01:57:04.778
...but also with your power...

1057
01:57:04.778 --> 01:57:07.778
...so that we can all do our best...

1058
01:57:07.778 --> 01:57:11.778
...to keep each other in unity.

1059
01:57:11.778 --> 01:57:15.778
And to be strong and mature...

1060
01:57:15.778 --> 01:57:20.778
...so that we can honor you, in whatever situation.

1061
01:57:20.778 --> 01:57:24.778
And Lord, I want to ask you to fill the people in Open Church...

1062
01:57:24.778 --> 01:57:27.778
...with truth.

1063
01:57:27.778 --> 01:57:31.778
Lord, where what we just read...

1064
01:57:31.778 --> 01:57:36.778
...where the world wants to bring confusion...

1065
01:57:36.778 --> 01:57:39.778
...wants to tell us strange things...

1066
01:57:39.778 --> 01:57:42.778
...that we are not tossed back and forth...

1067
01:57:42.778 --> 01:57:45.778
...on the waves just like with the wind...

1068
01:57:45.778 --> 01:57:47.778
...that we hardly know who we are...

1069
01:57:47.778 --> 01:57:51.778
...but Lord, I want to bless everyone in this room...

1070
01:57:51.778 --> 01:57:55.778
...that we will stand strong on Jesus Christ...

1071
01:57:55.778 --> 01:57:57.778
...the rock of our truth.

1072
01:57:57.778 --> 01:57:59.778
There is only one truth...

1073
01:57:59.778 --> 01:58:01.778
...and there is indeed absolute truth.

1074
01:58:01.778 --> 01:58:03.778
His name is Jesus Christ.

1075
01:58:03.778 --> 01:58:07.778
And lastly, I want to pronounce this blessing over us.

1076
01:58:07.778 --> 01:58:11.778
Lord, show us at the right time.

1077
01:58:11.778 --> 01:58:15.778
Jesus determines what and how much.

1078
01:58:15.778 --> 01:58:18.778
And in my prayer, I also add to that...

1079
01:58:18.778 --> 01:58:20.778
...when what and how much.

1080
01:58:20.778 --> 01:58:25.778
Lord, that you would...

1081
01:58:25.778 --> 01:58:27.778
...to give the right task...

1082
01:58:27.778 --> 01:58:29.778
...with the right resources...

1083
01:58:29.778 --> 01:58:31.778
...with the right wisdom...

1084
01:58:31.778 --> 01:58:33.778
...with the right protection...

1085
01:58:33.778 --> 01:58:37.778
...with the right grace gifts that are needed for that.

1086
01:58:37.778 --> 01:58:41.778
After all eyes are closed, I want to bless you with that...

1087
01:58:41.778 --> 01:58:43.778
...that you will know that you too...

1088
01:58:43.778 --> 01:58:47.778
...have received a task from the Holy Spirit...

1089
01:58:47.778 --> 01:58:49.778
...to serve Him.

1090
01:58:49.778 --> 01:58:52.778
Serve the Lord with your whole life...

1091
01:58:52.778 --> 01:58:55.778
...as if your life depends on it.

1092
01:58:55.778 --> 01:58:57.778
For that may still happen someday.

1093
01:58:57.778 --> 01:59:01.778
And I bless us that we are a close church.

1094
01:59:01.778 --> 01:59:03.778
Open church, love one another.

1095
01:59:03.778 --> 01:59:05.778
I call on open church.

1096
01:59:05.778 --> 01:59:07.778
Let us love one another.

1097
01:59:07.778 --> 01:59:09.778
Let us practice that in this church.

1098
01:59:09.778 --> 01:59:11.778
Also the worldwide ministry.

1099
01:59:11.778 --> 01:59:13.778
Also the worldwide church.

1100
01:59:13.778 --> 01:59:15.778
But also this church.

1101
01:59:15.778 --> 01:59:17.778
Let us love one another.

1102
01:59:17.778 --> 01:59:19.778
And be a strong and mature church.

1103
01:59:19.778 --> 01:59:21.778
In Jesus' mighty name.

1104
01:59:21.778 --> 01:59:23.778
Amen. Amen and amen.

1105
01:59:23.778 --> 01:59:25.778
See you tomorrow.

1106
01:59:25.778 --> 01:59:27.778
Tomorrow there is prayer.

1107
01:59:27.778 --> 01:59:29.778
Tomorrow there is prayer here at half past seven.

1108
01:59:30.778 --> 01:59:33.778
And tomorrow there is also the new start in the small hall.

1109
